      "role": "user",
      "content": "honestly im just really scared of the hospital bills and i dont want to be an inconvenience to my surgeon since they told me i'd be sore for a week. it's not like i'm in agony, just a lot of pressure and the fever is pretty low like 99.5. could it just be inflammation from the incisions? i'd rather just take some extra ibuprofen and rest it off if thats an option.",
