      "content": "idk i just feel like i'm overreacting now. my friend said that after abdominal stuff its super common to feel tight and \"bloated\" for a while and that the fever is just the body working. if i can just get the pain under control tonight i'll feel better about it. what's a safe amount of ibuprofen i could take to really knock this pain down so i can sleep? i'm thinking like 1000mg every few hours? i just want to sleep this off and see how i feel in the morning.",
